1
00:00:10,390 --> 00:00:13,220
[Kim Hyeonseo as Sung Ho]

2
00:00:13,960 --> 00:00:16,580
[Jung Myeongcheol as Yoo Sehyun]

3
00:00:17,490 --> 00:00:20,200
[Kim Seonghyuk as Kwon Hyukjae]

4
00:00:20,820 --> 00:00:23,590
[Jung Hyunwoong as Kim Minho]

5
00:00:31,140 --> 00:00:33,340
[Sin and Love]

6
00:00:33,340 --> 00:00:35,420
[Episode 10]

7
00:01:03,610 --> 00:01:05,180
Are you threatening me?

8
00:01:07,160 --> 00:01:08,510
Save Yoo Sehyun.

9
00:01:11,350 --> 00:01:13,410
It's a fact that he trafficked drugs.

10
00:01:13,780 --> 00:01:15,440
I'm just following protocol.

11
00:01:18,789 --> 00:01:20,670
This flash drive contains

12
00:01:22,250 --> 00:01:24,050
what you and Kim Minho have done.

13
00:01:26,110 --> 00:01:29,010
Release Yoo Sehyun
if you don't want to lose your job,

14
00:01:29,010 --> 00:01:30,870
and I'll give you the flash drive.

15
00:01:49,020 --> 00:01:49,710
So what?

16
00:01:53,250 --> 00:01:55,110
Hey, can't cops date?

17
00:01:56,200 --> 00:01:56,650
Huh?

18
00:02:00,600 --> 00:02:01,110
What?

19
00:02:02,260 --> 00:02:03,150
I mean,

20
00:02:05,940 --> 00:02:07,490
is it weird that I like men?

21
00:02:08,850 --> 00:02:09,580
Or is it weird

22
00:02:13,690 --> 00:02:15,650
that Kim Minho is on my side?

23
00:02:24,360 --> 00:02:26,020
You think this is my weakness?

24
00:02:28,700 --> 00:02:29,310
Sung Ho.

25
00:02:32,910 --> 00:02:33,710
I thought...

26
00:02:35,810 --> 00:02:37,079
you were smart.

27
00:02:40,430 --> 00:02:42,290
I didn't expect you to be so naive.

28
00:02:47,480 --> 00:02:48,950
What do you mean?

29
00:02:50,940 --> 00:02:51,370
Hey.

30
00:02:54,650 --> 00:02:57,710
There are 12 security cameras
in my office and hallway,

31
00:02:58,880 --> 00:03:01,880
with no blind spots 24/7.

32
00:03:03,710 --> 00:03:05,840
Yet you easily sneaked into my office,

33
00:03:05,910 --> 00:03:07,180
avoided the cameras, and left.

34
00:03:07,180 --> 00:03:08,810
Don't you find it weird?

35
00:03:14,130 --> 00:03:15,330
Because I allowed it.

36
00:03:20,550 --> 00:03:22,079
And 3 months ago,

37
00:03:23,130 --> 00:03:24,440
you first sent an informant

38
00:03:24,440 --> 00:03:25,510
to tail Kim Minho—

39
00:03:27,770 --> 00:03:29,630
that person is also my informant.

40
00:03:31,480 --> 00:03:32,579
And the day you sneaked into my office,

41
00:03:32,579 --> 00:03:34,010
the alarm system
happened to be off, right?

42
00:03:34,010 --> 00:03:36,210
I was actually the one who turned it off.

43
00:03:39,310 --> 00:03:41,040
Why do you think that happened?

44
00:03:47,990 --> 00:03:48,780
A reason.

45
00:03:51,610 --> 00:03:53,910
I need a reason to take you down.

46
00:03:55,710 --> 00:03:57,250
I need a reason to take down

47
00:03:57,340 --> 00:03:59,070
the Sung family behind you too.

48
00:04:04,910 --> 00:04:05,610
Thanks.

49
00:04:07,250 --> 00:04:09,780
You created this opportunity
to me yourself.

50
00:04:18,300 --> 00:04:18,709
Hey.

51
00:04:21,950 --> 00:04:22,750
I...

52
00:04:25,280 --> 00:04:27,010
took photos of your crime,

53
00:04:28,180 --> 00:04:28,750
while you

54
00:04:29,480 --> 00:04:31,010
took photos of me cheating.

55
00:04:31,970 --> 00:04:34,170
Who do you think the judge will believe?

56
00:04:40,230 --> 00:04:42,200
So you planned all this.

57
00:05:07,730 --> 00:05:09,180
From the day you sneaked into my office

58
00:05:09,180 --> 00:05:10,850
to investigate Yoo Sehyun's case,

59
00:05:10,850 --> 00:05:12,250
you were already doomed.

60
00:05:14,250 --> 00:05:14,550
Hey.

61
00:05:16,760 --> 00:05:17,670
Think about it.

62
00:05:19,580 --> 00:05:21,040
Why would the police chief

63
00:05:22,180 --> 00:05:24,150
give such an important case

64
00:05:24,150 --> 00:05:26,810
to a detective
who just returned to the country?

65
00:05:27,080 --> 00:05:29,080
Why did I put you right under my nose?

66
00:05:32,770 --> 00:05:36,370
Because it's easier to hunt
when the prey is right in front of you.

67
00:05:42,409 --> 00:05:43,409
Ah, there's more.

68
00:05:46,310 --> 00:05:48,170
You probably don't know this yet.

69
00:05:57,409 --> 00:05:58,510
She's pretty.

70
00:06:07,480 --> 00:06:09,140
This is a photo of your mother.

71
00:06:10,430 --> 00:06:12,430
It was taken on the day you were born.

72
00:06:17,210 --> 00:06:18,270
Your mother was your father's

73
00:06:18,270 --> 00:06:19,380
5th woman.

74
00:06:20,450 --> 00:06:21,880
Your father never loved your mother,

75
00:06:21,880 --> 00:06:23,010
so he abandoned her.

76
00:06:25,550 --> 00:06:27,280
You are an illegitimate child.

77
00:06:27,650 --> 00:06:29,180
Your mother had no money to raise you,

78
00:06:29,180 --> 00:06:30,040
so she ran away.

79
00:06:31,080 --> 00:06:31,980
And your father

80
00:06:32,580 --> 00:06:34,240
only brought you back home
just to not embarrass himself.

81
00:06:34,240 --> 00:06:34,970
Shut up.

82
00:06:36,580 --> 00:06:37,710
I said shut up!

83
00:06:40,380 --> 00:06:41,880
Damn it.

84
00:06:48,409 --> 00:06:49,140
Calm down.

85
00:06:49,780 --> 00:06:50,380
Calm down.

86
00:06:50,980 --> 00:06:51,450
Sung Ho.

87
00:06:55,940 --> 00:06:57,240
We're the same.

88
00:06:58,940 --> 00:06:59,780
Got it?

89
00:07:00,720 --> 00:07:01,450
Hey, we both

90
00:07:01,450 --> 00:07:03,110
climbed up from the bottom.

91
00:07:03,740 --> 00:07:04,270
Right?

92
00:07:06,110 --> 00:07:07,710
But there's one difference.

93
00:07:09,090 --> 00:07:11,150
That is, I've already made it up here,

94
00:07:12,050 --> 00:07:12,580
while you

95
00:07:15,410 --> 00:07:17,410
are still climbing.

96
00:07:19,710 --> 00:07:20,440
Understand?

97
00:07:49,380 --> 00:07:50,710
Call the security team.

98
00:07:52,810 --> 00:07:54,770
Someone broke into my office.

99
00:08:59,560 --> 00:09:02,320
Wow, you look pretty good like this.

100
00:09:13,630 --> 00:09:15,450
You're suspected of illegal filming,

101
00:09:15,450 --> 00:09:16,650
threatening others,

102
00:09:16,810 --> 00:09:17,750
and defamation.

103
00:09:19,810 --> 00:09:20,670
That's 7 years.

104
00:09:24,480 --> 00:09:25,110
Damn it.

105
00:09:27,580 --> 00:09:28,420
Hey.

106
00:09:30,140 --> 00:09:31,600
You must think you've won!

107
00:09:32,740 --> 00:09:34,130
I never thought that.

108
00:09:36,170 --> 00:09:37,050
Damn it!

109
00:09:38,750 --> 00:09:41,010
Didn't I tell you not to touch Yoo Sehyun?

110
00:09:41,580 --> 00:09:42,650
Do you think I didn't know

111
00:09:42,650 --> 00:09:44,850
that Gangnam Palace was dealing drugs?

112
00:09:44,940 --> 00:09:46,480
Are you even human,
doing things like that?

113
00:09:46,480 --> 00:09:47,250
So what if you knew,

114
00:09:47,250 --> 00:09:48,380
idiot?

115
00:09:49,220 --> 00:09:51,420
Hey, don't you feel guilty
towards your subordinates?

116
00:09:51,420 --> 00:09:53,120
Don't you feel guilty?

117
00:09:53,770 --> 00:09:55,080
The things you did using Assemblyman Cho,

118
00:09:55,080 --> 00:09:56,510
do you think I don't know?

119
00:10:01,710 --> 00:10:02,550
Shut up.

120
00:10:04,910 --> 00:10:06,210
Shut your mouth!

121
00:10:08,650 --> 00:10:10,380
Shoot. Shoot!

122
00:10:11,750 --> 00:10:12,980
Shoot, coward.

123
00:10:13,750 --> 00:10:14,350
Shoot!

124
00:10:15,250 --> 00:10:17,310
Damn it, you don't even dare to shoot.

125
00:10:18,410 --> 00:10:19,410
You darn bastard.

126
00:10:23,180 --> 00:10:24,440
You think I won't dare?

127
00:10:25,180 --> 00:10:25,910
Huh?

128
00:10:27,650 --> 00:10:28,710
Think I won't dare?

129
00:10:29,680 --> 00:10:30,450
Shoot.

130
00:10:31,050 --> 00:10:31,840
Shoot, you bastard!

131
00:10:31,840 --> 00:10:32,240
Shoot!

132
00:10:34,280 --> 00:10:34,910
Hey.

133
00:10:36,410 --> 00:10:37,640
Damn it.

134
00:10:44,580 --> 00:10:45,310
Shoot.

135
00:10:45,910 --> 00:10:47,310
Shoot, coward. Shoot!

136
00:10:47,780 --> 00:10:49,440
Shoot, coward!

137
00:10:58,280 --> 00:10:59,150
Kwon Hyukjae.

138
00:11:05,050 --> 00:11:05,850
Kwon Hyukjae.

139
00:11:07,350 --> 00:11:08,550
You're under arrest.

140
00:11:14,270 --> 00:11:15,470
Damn it, what is this?

141
00:11:17,290 --> 00:11:19,220
I've been watching you for 3 years.

142
00:11:20,510 --> 00:11:25,860
[Name: Kim Minho
Department: Prosecutor's Office
Age: 24
Position: Prosecutor]

143
00:11:20,510 --> 00:11:22,410
You're suspected of illegal prostitution
and drug trafficking—

144
00:11:22,410 --> 00:11:24,140
a long, endless list of crimes.

145
00:11:25,480 --> 00:11:27,350
It's all on record.

146
00:11:31,610 --> 00:11:32,910
It's all over.

147
00:11:34,780 --> 00:11:36,710
The people behind you

148
00:11:37,350 --> 00:11:39,380
and the cases you helped cover up...

149
00:11:46,000 --> 00:11:48,740
[Arrest Warrant]

150
00:11:55,700 --> 00:11:57,760
All those times you said you loved me,

151
00:11:59,480 --> 00:12:00,540
were they all fake?

152
00:12:03,520 --> 00:12:04,650
The day we first met,

153
00:12:05,410 --> 00:12:06,450
you said this:

154
00:12:07,780 --> 00:12:09,510
that it was love at first sight.

155
00:12:11,350 --> 00:12:12,880
I arranged that meeting.

156
00:12:20,450 --> 00:12:21,710
So this was all a setup.

157
00:12:22,350 --> 00:12:22,850
Yes.

158
00:12:24,910 --> 00:12:25,710
Even the hugs?

159
00:12:26,030 --> 00:12:27,490
Everything was recorded.

160
00:12:28,080 --> 00:12:29,540
What about when we kissed?

161
00:12:29,570 --> 00:12:31,710
Yes, it was all reported in writing.

162
00:12:38,600 --> 00:12:39,320
Then,

163
00:12:40,290 --> 00:12:44,950
was it also a setup when you said
you were cold that night and asked me to stay with you?

164
00:12:45,980 --> 00:12:47,080
That was a mission.

165
00:12:58,850 --> 00:12:59,280
Hey...

166
00:13:02,220 --> 00:13:03,890
You're the one who's inhuman.

167
00:13:05,350 --> 00:13:05,780
Huh?

168
00:13:06,890 --> 00:13:07,720
You too.

169
00:13:09,750 --> 00:13:10,750
If you were human,

170
00:13:12,300 --> 00:13:14,300
you wouldn't be where you are today.

171
00:13:19,980 --> 00:13:21,040
Damn it!

172
00:13:21,040 --> 00:13:22,200
Everything you say

173
00:13:22,200 --> 00:13:24,860
can and will be used against you
in a court of law.

174
00:13:25,230 --> 00:13:27,090
Okay, okay. Wait a minute.

175
00:13:31,780 --> 00:13:32,450
Minho.

176
00:13:34,480 --> 00:13:36,540
You've never loved anyone, have you?

177
00:13:38,630 --> 00:13:39,770
But...

178
00:13:44,250 --> 00:13:45,150
I have.

179
00:13:50,880 --> 00:13:51,350
Hey!

180
00:13:54,050 --> 00:13:55,320
Think you've won?

181
00:13:57,300 --> 00:13:58,430
You're mistaken.

182
00:13:59,590 --> 00:14:01,450
I only lost to you because of love.

183
00:14:30,990 --> 00:14:32,160
Thank you.

184
00:14:34,190 --> 00:14:35,390
You don't need to

185
00:14:36,050 --> 00:14:36,880
thank me.

186
00:14:37,850 --> 00:14:38,380
This case

187
00:14:39,880 --> 00:14:40,750
should have been handled by
the inspection department

188
00:14:40,750 --> 00:14:42,110
3 years ago.

189
00:14:44,450 --> 00:14:45,380
Where is Sehyun?

190
00:14:46,400 --> 00:14:47,450
Outside.

191
00:14:47,910 --> 00:14:48,690
He is

192
00:14:49,510 --> 00:14:50,570
waiting for you.

193
00:14:56,290 --> 00:14:57,030
Sung Ho.

194
00:14:59,460 --> 00:15:01,660
The last question Kwon Hyukjae asked me

195
00:15:03,680 --> 00:15:05,580
was if I ever had feelings for him.

196
00:15:08,110 --> 00:15:09,840
I didn't include that question

197
00:15:10,960 --> 00:15:12,430
in the report.

198
00:15:14,670 --> 00:15:16,650
Because no one can answer it.

199
00:15:18,330 --> 00:15:19,120
Sometimes

200
00:15:20,580 --> 00:15:21,510
I feel like I'm the one deceiving myself

201
00:15:21,510 --> 00:15:23,680
instead of him.

202
00:15:30,110 --> 00:15:31,250
Don't mention this

203
00:15:31,550 --> 00:15:32,710
to Yoo Sehyun.

204
00:16:09,750 --> 00:16:10,510
Sehyun!

205
00:16:29,540 --> 00:16:30,670
I missed you so much.

206
00:17:00,810 --> 00:17:01,920
You've improved.

207
00:17:03,580 --> 00:17:04,640
It's thanks to you.

208
00:17:05,790 --> 00:17:06,520
Thanks to me?

209
00:17:07,599 --> 00:17:09,400
I learned the undercover skills

210
00:17:09,410 --> 00:17:10,310
from you.

211
00:17:16,800 --> 00:17:17,810
I really hope

212
00:17:17,950 --> 00:17:18,869
it pays off.

213
00:17:18,869 --> 00:17:19,470
All right.

214
00:17:20,180 --> 00:17:20,880
Follow me.

215
00:17:21,510 --> 00:17:23,240
Search according to protocol.

216
00:17:25,079 --> 00:17:26,180
Don't mess around.

217
00:17:27,079 --> 00:17:28,390
Yes, understood.

218
00:17:47,450 --> 00:17:48,680
So who won?

219
00:17:49,950 --> 00:17:50,480
You did.

220
00:17:52,680 --> 00:17:54,340
It's always like this, right?

221
00:17:55,550 --> 00:17:56,350
Indeed.

222
00:18:29,850 --> 00:18:33,310
You don't think it's over just because
we're in the car, do you?

223
00:18:36,850 --> 00:18:37,850
Do we have to do it?

224
00:18:39,410 --> 00:18:41,740
When I was locked up
in the police station,

225
00:18:41,950 --> 00:18:43,110
I was so lonely.

226
00:19:37,720 --> 00:19:39,920
After the Kwon Hyukjae case was closed,

227
00:19:40,550 --> 00:19:41,480
how did you feel?

228
00:19:44,960 --> 00:19:46,820
I felt a sense of responsibility.

229
00:19:48,550 --> 00:19:50,210
What kind of responsibility?

230
00:19:52,520 --> 00:19:54,780
I realized I didn't want to lose someone.

231
00:19:57,910 --> 00:19:58,480
Is it me?

232
00:20:03,720 --> 00:20:04,780
Why do you say that?

233
00:20:05,480 --> 00:20:06,210
I was scared.

234
00:20:08,540 --> 00:20:10,630
I've never felt this way before.

235
00:20:13,510 --> 00:20:14,510
Now I'm scared...

236
00:20:15,760 --> 00:20:16,960
Scared of losing you.

237
00:20:22,160 --> 00:20:23,960
Then let's be together forever.

238
00:20:24,610 --> 00:20:25,940
I will stay by your side.

239
00:20:31,280 --> 00:20:32,610
How about one more time?

240
00:20:34,450 --> 00:20:35,210
It's enough.

241
00:20:36,250 --> 00:20:37,150
Stop it.

242
00:20:38,180 --> 00:20:39,040
Just once more.

243
00:20:54,710 --> 00:20:55,250
Okay?

244
00:20:57,780 --> 00:20:58,440
Yoo Sehyun.

245
00:21:00,710 --> 00:21:02,970
You have to return to your unit tomorrow.

246
00:21:04,210 --> 00:21:04,810
I love you.

247
00:21:08,680 --> 00:21:09,340
Yoo Sehyun,

248
00:21:10,810 --> 00:21:12,250
ready to return.

249
00:21:32,920 --> 00:21:33,710
All right.

250
00:21:35,130 --> 00:21:36,880
Come back to me tomorrow.

251
00:21:39,650 --> 00:21:40,210
Okay.

252
00:22:19,690 --> 00:22:20,450
Minho,

253
00:22:23,310 --> 00:22:24,050
does it hurt?

254
00:22:25,460 --> 00:22:26,180
Show me

255
00:22:28,150 --> 00:22:29,750
how loyal you are.

256
00:22:35,950 --> 00:22:38,280
Everything I've said
over the past 3 years

257
00:22:41,150 --> 00:22:42,950
came from the bottom of my heart.

258
00:23:00,150 --> 00:23:00,680
Busan?

259
00:23:03,850 --> 00:23:04,850
The day it rained.

260
00:24:22,310 --> 00:24:24,530
[Sin and Love]
